From 75d271576feb08dd380efe3b184426867f07608c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kees Van Kooten <kvankooten@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jan 2025 17:39:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Updated Glyph mapper and device for better compliance

---
 Rendering/ANARI/vtkAnariActorNode.h           |  5 ++--
 Rendering/ANARI/vtkAnariDevice.cxx            | 20 +++++++-------
 Rendering/ANARI/vtkAnariDevice.h              | 20 +++++++-------
 Rendering/ANARI/vtkAnariGlyph3DMapperNode.cxx | 26 +++++++++++--------
 Rendering/ANARI/vtkAnariGlyph3DMapperNode.h   | 18 ++++++++-----
